WEBVTT

00:03:29.621 --> 00:03:33.163
we're generally better off tilting our
rudder and charting a new course.

00:03:34.121 --> 00:03:37.246
In other words, expanding
your thinking at exactly

00:03:37.246 --> 00:03:40.829
the moment when all your instincts are
telling you to lock it down tight.

00:03:46.871 --> 00:03:49.996
I was in my 40s and I worked
in the mortgage division.

00:03:50.871 --> 00:03:54.621
When all of this mortgage business
hit and they laid off

00:03:54.621 --> 00:03:56.871
the entire division in Jacksonville

00:03:57.121 --> 00:04:00.413
in 2009, Erin Scott had been working
for a bank in Florida